OL,3,GNEWSAHull City footballer involved in
OL,4,Acar crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the club said it was
OL,7,F"relieved" to hear its player, who
OL,8,Fjoined the Tigers from Stoke earlier
OL,9,Fthis month, was unharmed.
